    "## PARSEC isochrone (1 Myr) and the linear approximation used for $A_V$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 5,
   "id": "8237ea2b",
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-09-16T18:35:27.312359Z",
